<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark">
  <title>Cyris Settings</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Settings for this Cyris deployment: model, digest, pipeline, notifications, sources and tracked topics.">
  <link rel="icon" href="favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Geist+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&display=swap">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/style.css">
  <style>
    /* This page's own layout. Every shared control and role comes from
       style.css; a rule here that another page also needs belongs there. */
    body { font-size: calc(14px * var(--type-scale)); line-height: 1.6; min-height: 100vh; }
    a { color: inherit; }
    button, input, select, textarea { font: inherit; color: inherit; }
    .page { max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--s-12) var(--s-4) var(--s-20); }
    .settings { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 220px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: var(--s-12); align-items: start; }
    .settings-nav { position: sticky; top: calc(var(--bar-h) + var(--s-6)); display: grid; border-left: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .settings-nav a { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; min-height: 44px; padding: var(--s-2) var(--s-4); margin-left: -1px; text-decoration: none; border-left: 2px solid transparent; transition: color var(--t-fast), border-color var(--t-fast); }
    .settings-nav a:hover { color: var(--text); }
    .settings-nav a[aria-current="page"] { color: var(--accent); border-left-color: var(--accent); }
    .dirty-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; background: var(--accent); border-radius: 50%; visibility: hidden; }
    .settings-nav a.dirty .dirty-dot { visibility: visible; }
    .nav-dots { display: flex; gap: var(--s-1); }
    .missing-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; background: var(--warn); border-radius: 50%; visibility: hidden; }
    .settings-nav a.missing .missing-dot { visibility: visible; }
    .tab-head { display: grid; gap: var(--s-2); margin-bottom: var(--s-8); max-width: var(--measure); }
    .form { display: grid; gap: var(--s-6); max-width: var(--measure); }
    .field-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr)); gap: var(--s-4); }
    .input.narrow { width: 96px; }
    .key-missing { color: var(--warn); }
    .actions-line { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--s-4); flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .toolbar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: var(--s-4); flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: var(--s-4); }
    .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; container-type: inline-size; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg-elev); }
    table.src { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; min-width: 640px; }
    table.src th { text-align: left; padding: var(--s-2) var(--s-5); background: var(--surface); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    table.src td { padding: var(--s-3) var(--s-5); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: calc(14px * var(--type-scale)); vertical-align: middle; }
    table.src tr.src-row { cursor: pointer; transition: background-color var(--t-fast); }
    table.src tr.src-row:hover, table.src tr.src-row.open { background: var(--surface); }
    table.src .name { white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 600; font-size: calc(18px * var(--type-scale)); }
    table.src .feed-problem { display: block; margin-top: var(--s-1); font-weight: 400; white-space: normal; color: var(--warn); }
    table.src tr.editor > td { background: var(--surface); padding: var(--s-5); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-strong); }
    .editor-body { position: sticky; left: var(--s-5); width: calc(100cqi - 2 * var(--s-5)); }
    tr.editor[inert] .form { opacity: .4; }
    tr.editor .form { max-width: none; }
    .editor-title { margin-bottom: var(--s-4); }
    .editor-foot { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--s-4); flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: var(--s-5); }
    table.src .target { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: calc(14px * var(--type-scale)); color: var(--text-dim); word-break: break-all; }
    table.src.assign { min-width: 0; }
    table.src .name .areas-note { display: block; margin-top: var(--s-1); font-weight: 400; white-space: normal; }
    table.src td.areas-pos-cell { width: 1%; }
    .areas-pos { width: 96px; }
    .areas-cell { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--s-3); }
    .areas-cell .select { flex: 0 1 320px; min-width: 0; }
    .areas-foot, .areas-foot .actions-line { align-items: flex-end; }
    .areas-merge .select { width: 200px; }
    .areas-part { margin-top: var(--s-12); }
    .tab-head + .areas-part { margin-top: 0; }
    .areas-part-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: var(--s-4); flex-wrap: wrap; min-height: 44px; margin-bottom: var(--s-3); }
    .areas-save { margin-top: var(--s-4); }
    table.src.areas-table, table.src.assign { min-width: 0; }
    .areas-threshold { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .areas-part { margin-top: var(--s-8); }
      .page { padding-top: var(--s-8); }
      .settings { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: var(--s-6); }
      .settings-nav { position: static; display: flex; overflow-x: auto; overflow-y: hidden; border-left: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
      /* The bar clips the tab's last pixel, the one over its bottom border, so the tab is 1px taller to keep 44px of taps. */
      .settings-nav a { border-left: 0; margin-left: 0; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; margin-bottom: -1px; min-height: calc(44px + 1px); white-space: nowrap; gap: var(--s-2); }
      .settings-nav a[aria-current="page"] { border-bottom-color: var(--accent); }
      .settings-nav::before { content: "›" / ""; order: 1; position: sticky; right: 0; pointer-events: none; flex: 0 0 var(--s-8); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; padding-right: var(--s-2); background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, var(--bg) var(--s-4)); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: calc(12px * var(--type-scale)); color: var(--text-dim); }
      .settings-nav::after { content: ""; order: 2; position: relative; flex: 0 0 var(--s-8); margin-left: calc(-1 * var(--s-8)); background: var(--bg); }
      table.src.assign thead { display: none; }
      table.src.assign, table.src.assign tbody, table.src.assign tr, table.src.assign td { display: block; }
      table.src.assign td.name { white-space: normal; border-bottom: 0; padding-bottom: var(--s-2); }
      table.src.assign td + td { padding-top: 0; }
      .areas-cell { flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .areas-cell .select { flex-basis: 100%; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
{% with current="settings" %}{% include "_site_bar.html.j2" %}{% endwith %}
  <main class="page">
    <div class="page-head">
      <span class="label">Settings</span>
      <h1 class="display">How cyris <em>runs</em></h1>
    </div>

    <div class="settings">
      <nav class="settings-nav" aria-label="Settings sections">
        <a class="label" href="#model" data-tab="model">Model <span class="nav-dots"><span class="missing-dot"></span><span class="dirty-dot"></span></span></a>
        <a class="label" href="#digest" data-tab="digest">Digest <span class="nav-dots"><span class="missing-dot"></span><span class="dirty-dot"></span></span></a>
        <a class="label" href="#theme" data-tab="theme">Theme <span class="nav-dots"><span class="missing-dot"></span><span class="dirty-dot"></span></span></a>
        <a class="label" href="#pipeline" data-tab="pipeline">Pipeline <span class="nav-dots"><span class="missing-dot"></span><span class="dirty-dot"></span></span></a>
        <a class="label" href="#notifications" data-tab="notifications">Notifications <span class="nav-dots"><span class="missing-dot"></span><span class="dirty-dot"></span></span></a>
        <a class="label" href="#sources" data-tab="sources">Sources <span class="nav-dots"><span class="missing-dot"></span><span class="dirty-dot"></span></span></a>
        <a class="label" href="#areas" data-tab="areas">Areas <span class="nav-dots"><span class="missing-dot"></span><span class="dirty-dot"></span></span></a>
        <a class="label" href="#tracking" data-tab="tracking">Tracking <span class="nav-dots"><span class="missing-dot"></span><span class="dirty-dot"></span></span></a>
      </nav>

      <div>
        <form class="tab" data-tab="model" id="model-form" novalidate hidden>
          <div class="tab-head">
            <h2 class="heading">Model</h2>
            <p class="small">The models the next run calls, and how it uses your votes.</p>
            <p class="small" data-loading>Loading settings…</p>
            <div class="notice err" id="model-missing" hidden></div>
          </div>
          <div class="form">
            <div class="field">
              <span class="label" id="provider-label">Provider</span>
              <div class="choices" id="providers" role="radiogroup" aria-labelledby="provider-label"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label class="label" for="model-input">Model</label>
              <input class="input" id="model-input" type="text" autocomplete="off">
              <p class="small" id="model-hint"></p>
              <button class="btn secondary sm" type="button" id="test-model" disabled>Test this model</button>
              <div class="notice" id="test-model-result" role="status" hidden></div>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <span class="label" id="embedding-provider-label">Embedding provider</span>
              <div class="choices" id="embedding-providers" role="radiogroup" aria-labelledby="embedding-provider-label"></div>
              <p class="small">The embedder vote similarity compares articles with. Its similarity cutoff comes with the model, so it is not set here.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label class="label" for="embedding-model-input">Embedding model</label>
              <input class="input" id="embedding-model-input" type="text" autocomplete="off">
              <p class="small">Checked with one real call when vote similarity is on.</p>
              <button class="btn secondary sm" type="button" id="test-embedding" disabled>Test this embedder</button>
              <div class="notice" id="test-embedding-result" role="status" hidden></div>
            </div>


            <div class="field">
              <label class="label" for="vote-enabled">Vote similarity</label>
              <select class="select" id="vote-enabled"><option value="false">Off</option><option value="true">On</option></select>
              <p class="small">Drop candidates close to an article you voted down. Preview what it would drop with <code>cyris vote-sim</code>; turning it on checks the embedder first.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label class="label" for="vote-seeds">Votes compared</label>
              <input class="input narrow" id="vote-seeds" type="number" min="1" autocomplete="off">
              <p class="small">How many of your most recent votes on each side a run compares against.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="actions-line">
              <button class="btn primary" type="submit" id="save-model" disabled>Save</button>
              <div class="notice" id="model-result" role="status" hidden></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </form>

        <form class="tab" data-tab="digest" id="digest-form" novalidate hidden>
          <div class="tab-head">
            <h2 class="heading">Digest</h2>
            <p class="small">When issues are published, what each one holds, and how large its text reads.</p>
            <p class="small" data-loading>Loading settings…</p>
            <div class="notice err" id="digest-missing" hidden></div>
          </div>
          <div class="form">
            <div class="field">
              <span class="label">Publish hours</span>
              <div class="field-row">
                <div class="field"><label class="small" for="morning">Morning</label><input class="input narrow" id="morning" type="number" min="0" max="23" autocomplete="off"></div>
                <div class="field"><label class="small" for="evening">Evening</label><input class="input narrow" id="evening" type="number" min="0" max="23" autocomplete="off"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="notice err" id="hours-error" data-field-error hidden></div>
              <p class="small">Whole hours from 0 to 23, in the timezone below; half hours are refused.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label class="label" for="timezone">Timezone</label>
              <select class="select" id="timezone"></select>
              <p class="small">The clock the publish hours are read in.</p>
              <p class="small" id="timezone-detected" hidden>Detected from this browser, and not saved yet.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label class="label" for="max-featured">Features cards</label>
              <input class="input narrow" id="max-featured" type="number" min="1" max="20" autocomplete="off">
              <p class="small">The most Features cards one issue shows, one article each.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label class="label" for="units-per-paragraph">News per paragraph</label>
              <input class="input narrow" id="units-per-paragraph" type="number" min="1" max="{{ units_per_batch }}" autocomplete="off">
              <p class="small">How many news stories each news paragraph aims to cover, from 1 to {{ units_per_batch }}. Fewer reads closer to a list; more reads denser.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label class="label" for="max-output">Articles in the digest</label>
              <input class="input narrow" id="max-output" type="number" min="1" autocomplete="off">
              <p class="small">The most read-lane articles one issue lists, with any news outside your areas. News in an area is not counted here; that area keeps its first few news paragraphs.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label class="label" for="output-language">Output language</label>
              <select class="select" id="output-language"></select>
              <p class="small">The language headlines and summaries are written in.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label class="label" for="style-prompt">Style</label>
              <textarea class="input" id="style-prompt" rows="4"></textarea>
              <p class="small">Your tone or focus for the summaries, in your own words; empty means none.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label class="label" for="type-scale">Type size</label>
              <select class="select" id="type-scale"><option value="0.875">Smaller</option><option value="1">Default</option><option value="1.125">Larger</option></select>
              <p class="small">How large the text is on every page. It applies within a minute, to issues already published too.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label class="label" for="rank-by-preference">Order by your votes</label>
              <select class="select" id="rank-by-preference"><option value="false">Off</option><option value="true">On</option></select>
              <p class="small">Put the headlines and Features closest to what you voted up first. Headlines a full issue leaves out stay for the next one.</p>
              <p class="small" id="rank-needs" hidden>Needs vote similarity on, under Model.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label class="label" for="preference-source">Order judged by</label>
              <select class="select" id="preference-source"><option value="cosine">Title similarity</option><option value="clef">Clef</option></select>
              <p class="small">Who decides which headlines are closest to your votes. An issue Clef cannot fully score uses title similarity.</p>
              <p class="small" id="clef-needs" hidden>Clef needs a Workers AI token: set CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID and CLOUDFLARE_AI_TOKEN (or CLOUDFLARE_EMBEDDING_API_TOKEN).</p>
            </div>
            <div class="actions-line">
              <button class="btn primary" type="submit" id="save-digest" disabled>Save</button>
              <div class="notice" id="digest-result" role="status" hidden></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </form>

        <form class="tab" data-tab="theme" id="theme-form" novalidate hidden>
          <div class="tab-head">
            <h2 class="heading">Theme</h2>
            <p class="small">The palette the pages are drawn in. Picking one switches this page at once; Save stores it for the digest pages, where every read carries it.</p>
            <p class="small" data-loading>Loading settings…</p>
            <div class="notice err" id="theme-missing" hidden></div>
          </div>
          <div class="form">
            <div class="field">
              <label class="label" for="page-theme">Palette</label>
              <select class="select" id="page-theme">
                <option value="default">Default — the dark spec palette</option>
                <option value="light">Light</option>
                <option value="one_dark">One Dark</option>
                <option value="catppuccin">Catppuccin</option>
                <option value="nord">Nord</option>
                <option value="tokyo_night">Tokyo Night</option>
                <option value="github_dark">GitHub Dark</option>
              </select>
              <p class="small">Colour keeps its two meanings in every palette: the accent what you voted up, the warn what you voted down, everything else neutral.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="actions-line">
              <button class="btn primary" type="submit" id="save-theme" disabled>Save</button>
              <div class="notice" id="theme-result" role="status" hidden></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </form>

        <form class="tab" data-tab="pipeline" id="pipeline-form" novalidate hidden>
          <div class="tab-head">
            <h2 class="heading">Pipeline</h2>
            <p class="small">How far back each run looks, how much it reads, and where it cuts.</p>
            <p class="small" data-loading>Loading settings…</p>
            <div class="notice err" id="pipeline-missing" hidden></div>
          </div>
          <div class="form">
            <div class="field">
              <label class="label" for="window-hours">Window (hours)</label>
              <input class="input narrow" id="window-hours" type="number" min="1" max="168" autocomplete="off">
              <p class="small">How far back a run looks for articles.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label class="label" for="max-articles">Articles per run</label>
              <input class="input narrow" id="max-articles" type="number" min="1" autocomplete="off">
              <p class="small">How many of the window's newest articles, by publish time, one run scores and digests across all sources.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label class="label" for="featured-threshold">Top story score</label>
              <input class="input narrow" id="featured-threshold" type="number" min="0" max="100" autocomplete="off">
              <p class="small">Two or more articles on one topic scoring at least this share the Top story.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label class="label" for="summarize-threshold">Summary score</label>
              <input class="input narrow" id="summarize-threshold" type="number" min="0" max="100" autocomplete="off">
              <p class="small">A read-lane article scoring below this is listed for attention instead of summarized.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <span class="label">Characters read</span>
              <div class="field-row">
                <div class="field"><label class="small" for="scoring-snippet">Scoring</label><input class="input narrow" id="scoring-snippet" type="number" min="1" autocomplete="off"></div>
                <div class="field"><label class="small" for="summarize-snippet">Summary</label><input class="input narrow" id="summarize-snippet" type="number" min="1" autocomplete="off"></div>
                <div class="field"><label class="small" for="filter-snippet">News clustering and headlines</label><input class="input narrow" id="filter-snippet" type="number" min="1" autocomplete="off"></div>
              </div>
              <p class="small">How much of each article the model reads at each step; more costs more per call.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label class="label" for="reasoning-effort">Reasoning effort</label>
              <select class="select" id="reasoning-effort"><option value="default">Default</option><option value="low">Low</option><option value="medium">Medium</option><option value="high">High</option></select>
              <p class="small">How hard the model thinks before it answers; more costs more tokens and time. Default keeps each provider's own level, except low on OpenAI; Workers AI always runs at low, and Save checks the level with one call.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="actions-line">
              <button class="btn primary" type="submit" id="save-pipeline" disabled>Save</button>
              <div class="notice" id="pipeline-result" role="status" hidden></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </form>

        <form class="tab" data-tab="notifications" id="notify-form" action="/api/settings/notify" novalidate hidden>
          <div class="tab-head">
            <h2 class="heading">Notifications</h2>
            <p class="small">Where a finished issue is announced.</p>
            <p class="small" data-loading>Loading settings…</p>
            <div class="notice err" id="notifications-missing" hidden></div>
          </div>
          <div class="form">
            <div class="field">
              <label class="label" for="discord-webhook">Discord webhook</label>
              <input class="input" id="discord-webhook" type="text" placeholder="https://discord.com/api/webhooks/..." autocomplete="off">
              <p class="small">To change it, paste the whole URL; it is saved once Discord confirms it exists. Turn off clears it: runs then finish without a message.</p>
              <p class="small" id="notify-state" hidden>Notifications are off.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label class="label" for="email-to">Email to</label>
              <input class="input" id="email-to" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" autocomplete="off">
              <p class="small">Leave it empty to send no mail. It must be a verified destination in Cloudflare Email Routing, and is saved once a test message reaches it.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label class="label" for="email-from">Email from</label>
              <input class="input" id="email-from" type="email" placeholder="digest@your-domain" autocomplete="off">
              <p class="small">An address on your Email Routing domain.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="actions-line">
              <button class="btn primary" type="submit" id="save-notify" disabled>Save</button>
              <button class="btn danger" type="button" id="notify-off" hidden>Turn off</button>
              <div class="notice" id="notify-result" role="status" hidden></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </form>

        <div class="tab" data-tab="sources" hidden>
          <div class="tab-head">
            <h2 class="heading">Sources</h2>
            <p class="small">The feeds and newsletter senders the next run reads.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="toolbar">
            <div class="seg" role="group" aria-label="Filter by type">
              <button type="button" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All</button>
              <button type="button" data-filter="rss" aria-pressed="false">RSS</button>
              <button type="button" data-filter="newsletter" aria-pressed="false">Newsletter</button>
            </div>
            <div class="actions-line">
              <div class="notice" id="sources-notice" role="status" hidden></div>
              <button class="btn primary" type="button" id="add-source" disabled>+ Add source</button>
              <button class="btn secondary" type="button" id="import-opml" hidden>Import OPML…</button>
              <input type="file" id="opml-file" accept=".opml,.xml,application/xml,text/xml" hidden>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="table-wrap">
            <table class="src">
              <thead><tr><th class="label">Name</th><th class="label">Type</th><th class="label">Lane</th><th class="label">Feed or sender</th><th class="label">Tags</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody id="src-body"><tr data-loading><td colspan="5" class="small">Loading sources…</td></tr></tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tab" data-tab="areas" hidden>
          <div class="tab-head">
            <h2 class="heading">Areas</h2>
            <p class="small">The areas the model files each article under, and the proposals waiting for you.</p>
          </div>
          <section class="areas-part" aria-labelledby="areas-active-h">
            <div class="areas-part-head"><h3 class="label" id="areas-active-h">Areas</h3></div>
            <div class="table-wrap">
              <table class="src areas-table">
                <thead><tr><th class="label">Name</th><th class="label">Position</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody id="area-body"><tr data-loading><td colspan="2" class="small">Loading areas…</td></tr></tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <div class="actions-line areas-save">
              <button class="btn primary" type="button" id="save-order" disabled>Save order</button>
              <div class="notice" id="order-result" role="status" hidden></div>
            </div>
          </section>
          <section class="areas-part" aria-labelledby="areas-proposed-h">
            <div class="areas-part-head"><h3 class="label" id="areas-proposed-h">Proposed</h3></div>
            <div class="table-wrap">
              <table class="src areas-table">
                <thead><tr><th class="label">Name</th><th class="label">Counts</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody id="proposed-body"></tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </section>
          <section class="areas-part" aria-labelledby="areas-sources-h">
            <div class="areas-part-head">
              <h3 class="label" id="areas-sources-h">Sources</h3>
              <div class="actions-line">
                <div class="notice" id="areas-notice" role="status" hidden></div>
                <button class="btn primary" type="button" id="propose-areas" disabled>Propose areas from my sources</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="table-wrap">
              <table class="src assign">
                <thead><tr><th class="label">Source</th><th class="label">Area</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody id="assign-body"><tr data-loading><td colspan="2" class="small">Loading sources…</td></tr></tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <div class="actions-line areas-save">
              <button class="btn primary" type="button" id="save-assign" disabled>Save assignments</button>
              <div class="notice" id="assign-result" role="status" hidden></div>
            </div>
          </section>
          <section class="areas-part" id="threshold-block" aria-labelledby="areas-threshold-h">
            <div class="areas-part-head"><h3 class="label" id="areas-threshold-h">Birth threshold</h3></div>
            <div class="field-row areas-threshold">
              <div class="field"><label class="label" for="th-articles">Articles</label><input class="input narrow" id="th-articles" type="number" min="1" step="1" autocomplete="off" disabled></div>
              <div class="field"><label class="label" for="th-issues">Issues</label><input class="input narrow" id="th-issues" type="number" min="1" step="1" autocomplete="off" disabled></div>
            </div>
            <div class="actions-line areas-save">
              <button class="btn primary" type="button" id="save-threshold" disabled>Save</button>
              <div class="notice" id="threshold-result" role="status" hidden></div>
              <p class="small" id="threshold-hint" hidden>Birth threshold not set</p>
            </div>
          </section>
          <details class="more areas-part"><summary>Closed</summary>
            <ul class="small" id="closed-list"></ul>
          </details>
        </div>

        <div class="tab" data-tab="tracking" hidden>
          <div class="tab-head">
            <h2 class="heading">Tracking</h2>
            <p class="small">Topics each issue lists every close article for, under Tracking; a topic set for another embedding model is skipped.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="toolbar">
            <div class="notice" id="topics-notice" role="status" hidden></div>
            <button class="btn primary" type="button" id="add-topic" disabled>+ Add topic</button>
          </div>
          <div class="table-wrap">
            <table class="src">
              <thead><tr><th class="label">Name</th><th class="label">Description</th><th class="label">Threshold</th><th class="label">Embedding model</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody id="topic-body"><tr data-loading><td colspan="4" class="small">Loading topics…</td></tr></tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <template id="editor-tpl">
    <tr class="editor"><td colspan="5"><div class="editor-body">
      <h3 class="label editor-title"></h3>
      <div class="form">
        <div class="field-row">
          <div class="field"><label class="label" for="e-name">Name</label><input class="input" id="e-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="off"></div>
          <div class="field"><span class="label">Type</span>
            <div class="seg" role="group" aria-label="Type"><button type="button" data-type="rss">RSS</button><button type="button" data-type="newsletter">Newsletter</button></div>
          </div>
          <div class="field"><label class="label" for="e-lane">Lane</label>
            <select class="select" id="e-lane" name="lane"><option>skim</option><option>read</option><option>follow</option></select>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field" data-for="rss"><label class="label" for="e-url">Feed URL</label><input class="input" id="e-url" name="url" type="text" autocomplete="off"></div>
        <div class="field" data-for="newsletter"><label class="label" for="e-email">Sender match</label><input class="input" id="e-email" name="email_match" type="text" placeholder="from:hi@example.com" autocomplete="off">
          <p class="small">Maps a sender to this source; email routing itself stays in the Cloudflare dashboard.</p></div>
        <div class="field" data-for="newsletter"><label class="label" for="e-home">Homepage</label><input class="input" id="e-home" name="homepage" type="text" autocomplete="off"></div>
        <div class="field"><label class="label" for="e-tags">Tags</label><input class="input" id="e-tags" name="tags" type="text" placeholder="comma separated" autocomplete="off"></div>
        <div class="field-row">
          <div class="field"><label class="label" for="e-area">Area</label>
            <select class="select" id="e-area" name="area_id"><option value="">None</option></select>
            <span class="pill" data-suggested hidden>Suggested</span>
          </div>
          <div class="field"><button class="btn secondary" type="button" data-act="suggest">Suggest</button></div>
        </div>
        <p class="small" data-suggest-note hidden></p>
      </div>
      <div class="editor-foot">
        <div class="actions-line">
          <button class="btn primary" type="button" data-act="save" disabled>Save source</button>
          <button class="btn secondary" type="button" data-act="cancel">Cancel</button>
          <div class="notice" role="status" hidden></div>
        </div>
        <div class="actions-line">
          <button class="btn danger" type="button" data-act="retire">Retire</button>
          <div class="notice" role="status" hidden></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div></td></tr>
  </template>

  <template id="area-editor-tpl">
    <tr class="editor"><td colspan="2"><div class="editor-body">
      <h3 class="label editor-title"></h3>
      <div class="form">
        <div class="field"><label class="label" for="a-name">Name</label><input class="input" id="a-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="off"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="editor-foot areas-foot">
        <div class="actions-line">
          <button class="btn primary" type="button" data-act="activate" data-proposed hidden>Activate</button>
          <button class="btn secondary" type="button" data-act="save" disabled>Save name</button>
          <button class="btn secondary" type="button" data-act="cancel">Cancel</button>
          <div class="notice" role="status" hidden></div>
        </div>
        <div class="actions-line" data-proposed hidden>
          <button class="btn danger" type="button" data-act="dismiss">Dismiss</button>
          <div class="field areas-merge"><label class="label" for="a-into">Merge into</label><select class="select" id="a-into" name="into"></select></div>
          <button class="btn danger" type="button" data-act="merge">Merge</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div></td></tr>
  </template>

  <template id="topic-editor-tpl">
    <tr class="editor"><td colspan="4"><div class="editor-body">
      <h3 class="label editor-title"></h3>
      <div class="form">
        <div class="field"><label class="label" for="t-name">Name</label><input class="input" id="t-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="off"></div>
        <div class="field"><label class="label" for="t-description">Description</label><textarea class="input" id="t-description" name="description" rows="3"></textarea>
          <p class="small">One sentence saying what the topic is about.</p></div>
        <div class="field-row">
          <div class="field"><label class="label" for="t-threshold">Threshold</label><input class="input narrow" id="t-threshold" name="threshold" type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" autocomplete="off"></div>
          <div class="field"><label class="label" for="t-model">Embedding model</label><input class="input" id="t-model" name="model" type="text" autocomplete="off"></div>
        </div>
        <p class="small">The cosine a title must reach, on that model's scale; there is no default. <code>cyris topic-sim</code> ranks the window's titles against the description: pick the lowest cosine still on topic.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="editor-foot">
        <div class="actions-line">
          <button class="btn primary" type="button" data-act="save" disabled>Save topic</button>
          <button class="btn secondary" type="button" data-act="cancel">Cancel</button>
          <div class="notice" role="status" hidden></div>
        </div>
        <div class="actions-line">
          <button class="btn danger" type="button" data-act="remove">Remove</button>
          <div class="notice" role="status" hidden></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div></td></tr>
  </template>

<script src="/static/settings.js"></script>
{% include "_probe_script.html.j2" %}
</body>
</html>
